# Evolution Pause Kill-Switch

Create an empty file named `evolution/PAUSE` (without `.example`) to immediately halt all
autonomous background evolution sidecars (`hourly-ci-monitor-fix`,
`nightly-tech-debt-refactor`, `weekly-architecture-planner`) and cause
`node scripts/evolution/check-constitution.mjs --enforce-pause` to exit non-zero.

Remove `evolution/PAUSE` when ready to resume autonomous evolution runs.
